# id: N1-P2
# title: A test account wins a tournament bout; this week's paper names it in Arena
# needs: client
# why-client: the bouts are fought in the client (the GM's seat in a forced 2-seat Rookie/Veteran tournament)
# source: WORLD_SYSTEMS_PLAN.md N1 live check P2; docs/PVP_PLAN.md V5 (!pvp tournament start)
login --character TestGm
online TestGm
queue TestGm !pvp tournament start VETERAN 2 1 me
# Fight the bout in the client until Cesar names a champion; then the week's tournament row is DONE.
shot p2-bout
expectsql SELECT COUNT(*) FROM pvp_tournament WHERE state = 'DONE' AND champion_id = (SELECT id FROM characters WHERE name = 'TestGm') LIMIT 1 >= 1 within 900
queue TestGm !paper current
expectgm == Arena == within 30
expectgm TestGm within 10
